VALUES ('steel-plate', 'Steel Plate — 6mm Thick, 1.2m x 2.4m Sheet, Mild Steel (New)', 'structural-steel', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 270, '/assets/products/steel-plate.webp', 'Mild Steel Plate 6mm is the standard structural plate for base plates, gusset plates, and general fabrication. The 6mm thickness provides adequate strength for column base plates, connection plates, and machinery mounting bases. The hot-rolled finish provides a mill scale surface suitable for welding and bolting, and the S275JR grade ensures minimum yield strength of 275 MPa. Each 1.2m x 2.4m sheet provides 2.88 square meters of material, and the flatness tolerances meet structural fabrication standards. For steel fabricators and structural contractors who need reliable mild steel plate for welded and bolted connections. Condition: Brand new, hot-rolled mild steel plate, mill finish.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/steel-plate.webp', 77000, 4.5, 1, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

