VALUES ('steel-plate-1', 'Steel Plate — 10mm Thick, 1.2m x 2.4m Sheet, Mild Steel (New)', 'structural-steel', 135000, 135000, 110000, 10, 450, '/assets/products/steel-plate-1.webp', 'Mild Steel Plate 10mm is the heavy structural plate for machine bases, heavy brackets, and load-bearing applications. The 10mm thickness provides substantial section modulus for bending resistance, and the S275JR grade ensures consistent mechanical properties. The hot-rolled surface is suitable for welding with standard electrodes, and the dimensional tolerances meet BS EN 10029 standards. Each sheet weighs approximately 271kg, requiring mechanical handling for movement. For heavy fabricators and industrial contractors who need thick steel plate for robust structural and machinery applications. Condition: Brand new, hot-rolled mild steel plate, mill finish.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 110000, '/assets/products/steel-plate-1.webp', 122000, 4.5, 1, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

