VALUES ('steel-plate-2', 'Steel Plate — 12mm Thick, 1.2m x 2.4m Sheet, Mild Steel (New)', 'structural-steel', 165000, 165000, 135000, 10, 540, '/assets/products/steel-plate-2.webp', 'Mild Steel Plate 12mm is the extra-heavy plate for major structural connections, heavy machinery bases, and armor applications. The substantial thickness provides exceptional strength and rigidity for demanding applications, and the S275JR or S355JR grades meet structural requirements. The hot-rolled finish with mill scale is suitable for welding and surface preparation, and the flatness meets heavy plate tolerances. Each sheet weighs approximately 325kg. For heavy engineering contractors, ship repairers, and industrial fabricators who need maximum-thickness structural plate for critical applications. Condition: Brand new, hot-rolled mild steel plate, mill finish.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 135000, '/assets/products/steel-plate-2.webp', 150000, 4.5, 1, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

