VALUES ('angle-iron', 'Angle Iron — 50mm x 50mm x 6mm, Full Length (12m), Mild Steel (New)', 'structural-steel', 28500, 28500, 23000, 10, 150.0, '/assets/products/angle-iron.webp', 'Angle Iron 50x50x6mm is the versatile structural section used for brackets, frames, supports, and general fabrication. The equal-leg angle provides symmetrical strength in both directions, and the 6mm thickness offers substantial capacity for medium-duty applications. The hot-rolled finish with mill scale is suitable for welding, and the S275JR grade ensures minimum yield strength. Each 12-meter length can be cut to size for specific applications, and the standard dimensions ensure compatibility with standard bolts and connection details. For fabricators and builders who need reliable angle sections for framing, bracing, and support structures. Condition: Brand new, hot-rolled equal angle, mill finish.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 23000, '/assets/products/angle-iron.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

