VALUES ('universal-beam', 'Universal Beam (UB) — 203mm x 133mm x 25kg/m, Full Length (12m), S275JR (New)', 'structural-steel', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 300.0, '/assets/products/universal-beam.webp', 'Universal Beam 203x133x25 is the standard I-section for floor beams, roof beams, and structural framing in buildings up to three stories. The I-shape provides exceptional bending efficiency, with most material concentrated in the flanges where stress is highest. The 25kg/m weight provides adequate capacity for typical residential and light commercial spans, and the S275JR grade ensures minimum yield strength of 275 MPa. Each 12-meter length weighs 300kg. For structural steel contractors and building frame fabricators who need standard I-beams for conventional steel building construction. Condition: Brand new, hot-rolled universal beam, mill finish with grade marking.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/universal-beam.webp', 113000, 4.5, 1, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

