VALUES ('galvanized-pipe', 'Galvanized Pipe — 1/2 Inch (15mm), Medium Gauge, Full Length (6m) (New)', 'plumbing', 8500, 8500, 6000, 10, 15.0, '/assets/products/galvanized-pipe.webp', 'Galvanized Steel Pipe 1/2 inch is the standard water distribution pipe for residential and light commercial plumbing. The hot-dip galvanized coating provides corrosion resistance for buried and exposed applications, and the threaded ends enable easy connection with standard fittings. The medium gauge wall thickness provides adequate pressure rating for municipal water supply pressures, and the BS 1387 or ASTM A53 compliance ensures dimensional consistency. Suitable for cold water distribution, fire suppression lines, and general plumbing applications. For plumbing contractors and homeowners who need reliable galvanized pipe for water distribution with proven corrosion resistance. Condition: Brand new, hot-dip galvanized, threaded both ends.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 6000, '/assets/products/galvanized-pipe.webp', 7000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

