VALUES ('galvanized-pipe-1', 'Galvanized Pipe — 3/4 Inch (20mm), Medium Gauge, Full Length (6m) (New)', 'plumbing', 11500, 11500, 9000, 10, 15.0, '/assets/products/galvanized-pipe-1.webp', 'Galvanized Steel Pipe 3/4 inch is the primary water distribution pipe for residential buildings and light commercial applications. The larger diameter provides increased flow capacity for main distribution lines, and the hot-dip galvanized coating ensures long service life in water service. The medium gauge construction withstands typical municipal water pressures, and the standard threading enables connection with galvanized fittings. Suitable for main water lines, risers, and branch distribution in buildings up to three stories. For plumbing contractors who need standard water distribution pipe with reliable corrosion protection and standard fitting compatibility. Condition: Brand new, hot-dip galvanized, threaded both ends.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/galvanized-pipe-1.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

