VALUES ('galvanized-pipe-2', 'Galvanized Pipe — 1 Inch (25mm), Medium Gauge, Full Length (6m) (New)', 'plumbing', 15500, 15500, 12000, 10, 15.0, '/assets/products/galvanized-pipe-2.webp', 'Galvanized Steel Pipe 1 inch is the main distribution pipe for commercial buildings and large residential installations. The 25mm diameter provides substantial flow capacity for buildings with multiple bathrooms and fixtures, and the hot-dip galvanized coating ensures decades of service in water applications. The medium gauge wall thickness meets pressure requirements for typical building services, and the standard threading enables connection with 1-inch galvanized fittings. Suitable for main risers, distribution headers, and commercial water services. For commercial plumbing contractors and building services engineers who need large-diameter galvanized pipe for high-capacity water distribution. Condition: Brand new, hot-dip galvanized, threaded both ends.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 12000, '/assets/products/galvanized-pipe-2.webp', 14000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

