VALUES ('galvanized-pipe-3', 'Galvanized Pipe — 2 Inch (50mm), Medium Gauge, Full Length (6m) (New)', 'plumbing', 32500, 32500, 26000, 10, 15.0, '/assets/products/galvanized-pipe-3.webp', 'Galvanized Steel Pipe 2 inch is the large-diameter pipe for commercial water mains, fire suppression systems, and industrial process lines. The 50mm diameter provides high flow capacity for buildings with extensive plumbing systems, and the hot-dip galvanized coating protects against corrosion in demanding applications. The medium gauge construction withstands higher pressures and mechanical loads, and the standard threading enables connection with large galvanized fittings. Suitable for fire hydrant lines, main building services, and industrial water distribution. For commercial and industrial contractors who need large-diameter galvanized pipe for high-capacity services. Condition: Brand new, hot-dip galvanized, threaded both ends.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 26000, '/assets/products/galvanized-pipe-3.webp', 29000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('stainless-steel-pipe', 'Stainless Steel Pipe — 1 Inch (25mm), Schedule 40, 304 Grade, Full Length (6m) (New)', 'plumbing', 28500, 28500, 23000, 10, 15.0, '/assets/products/stainless-steel-pipe.webp', 'Stainless Steel Pipe 1 inch Schedule 40 in 304 grade is the corrosion-resistant pipe for food processing, pharmaceutical, and high-end plumbing applications. The 304 austenitic stainless steel provides excellent corrosion resistance in water and mild chemical environments, and the Schedule 40 wall thickness provides substantial pressure rating. The smooth interior surface minimizes flow resistance and bacterial adhesion, making it ideal for potable water and sanitary applications. Suitable for high-end residential plumbing, food industry process lines, and pharmaceutical installations. For contractors working on premium residential, food, and pharmaceutical projects who need hygienic, corrosion-resistant piping. Condition: Brand new, 304 stainless steel, mill finish, beveled ends.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 23000, '/assets/products/stainless-steel-pipe.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('stainless-steel-pipe-1', 'Stainless Steel Pipe — 2 Inch (50mm), Schedule 40, 304 Grade, Full Length (6m) (New)', 'plumbing', 52000, 52000, 42000, 10, 15.0, '/assets/products/stainless-steel-pipe-1.webp', 'Stainless Steel Pipe 2 inch Schedule 40 in 304 grade is the large-diameter corrosion-resistant pipe for industrial process lines, commercial kitchens, and high-capacity sanitary applications. The 304 stainless steel provides excellent resistance to food acids, cleaning chemicals, and water corrosion, and the Schedule 40 wall thickness handles industrial pressures. The smooth, non-porous surface is easy to clean and sanitize, meeting hygiene requirements for food and pharmaceutical processing. Suitable for brewery process lines, dairy equipment, commercial kitchen drainage, and pharmaceutical process piping. For industrial contractors and food processing engineers who need large-diameter hygienic piping with proven corrosion resistance. Condition: Brand new, 304 stainless steel, mill finish, beveled ends.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 42000, '/assets/products/stainless-steel-pipe-1.webp', 47000, 4.5, 1, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('longspan-aluminium-roofing-sheet', 'Longspan Aluminium Roofing Sheet — 0.45mm, Metcoppo Design, Per Meter (New)', 'roofing', 4800, 4800, 3000, 10, 6.0, '/assets/products/longspan-aluminium-roofing-sheet.webp', 'Longspan Aluminium Roofing Sheet in 0.45mm Metcoppo design is the premium roofing solution that combines durability with architectural elegance. The Metcoppo (step-tile) profile creates the appearance of traditional clay tiles with the lightweight, corrosion-resistant benefits of aluminum. The 0.45mm thickness provides adequate strength for standard roof spans up to 1.2 meters, and the high-grade aluminum alloy with color coating resists fading and chalking under intense UV exposure. Available in a wide range of colors including traffic red, bottle green, chocolate brown, and pure white to match any architectural vision. For homeowners and developers who want the timeless appearance of tile roofing with the longevity and low maintenance of aluminum. Condition: Brand new, factory-coated aluminum, full length delivery.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 3000, '/assets/products/longspan-aluminium-roofing-sheet.webp', 4000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('longspan-aluminium-roofing-sheet-1', 'Longspan Aluminium Roofing Sheet — 0.55mm, Metcoppo Design, Per Meter (New)', 'roofing', 5800, 5800, 4000, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/longspan-aluminium-roofing-sheet-1.webp', 'Longspan Aluminium Roofing Sheet in 0.55mm Metcoppo design is the heavy-duty option for larger spans and high-wind zones. The increased thickness provides greater rigidity for purlin spacings up to 1.5 meters, reducing material and labor costs for wide-span roofs. The enhanced profile depth improves water drainage capacity during tropical downpours, and the heavier gauge resists denting from foot traffic during maintenance. The premium color coating with PVDF or SMP technology ensures 15-20 year color retention in Nigerian UV conditions. For commercial buildings, churches, and large residential estates where roof durability and reduced maintenance are priorities. Condition: Brand new, factory-coated aluminum, full length delivery.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 4000, '/assets/products/longspan-aluminium-roofing-sheet-1.webp', 5000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('longspan-aluminium-roofing-sheet-2', 'Longspan Aluminium Roofing Sheet — 0.45mm, Plain Design, Per Meter (New)', 'roofing', 4200, 4200, 3000, 10, 6.0, '/assets/products/longspan-aluminium-roofing-sheet-2.webp', 'Longspan Aluminium Roofing Sheet in 0.45mm plain design is the economical roofing choice for warehouses, factories, and budget-conscious residential projects. The simple corrugated profile provides excellent water shedding with minimal material usage, and the 0.45mm thickness offers adequate strength for standard applications. The aluminum construction eliminates rust concerns that plague steel roofing, and the lightweight nature reduces structural loading and installation labor. Available in standard colors with 10-15 year coating warranties. For industrial developers and budget-focused builders who want reliable, maintenance-free roofing at the most competitive aluminum price point. Condition: Brand new, factory-coated aluminum, full length delivery.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 3000, '/assets/products/longspan-aluminium-roofing-sheet-2.webp', 3000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('longspan-aluminium-roofing-sheet-3', 'Longspan Aluminium Roofing Sheet — 0.70mm, Plain Design, Per Meter (New)', 'roofing', 7200, 7200, 5000, 10, 10.0, '/assets/products/longspan-aluminium-roofing-sheet-3.webp', 'Longspan Aluminium Roofing Sheet in 0.70mm plain design is the extra-heavy gauge for industrial warehouses, aircraft hangars, and extreme weather zones. The substantial thickness provides walk-on strength for maintenance access without denting, and the enhanced profile rigidity spans up to 2.0 meters between purlins. The heavy gauge resists impact damage from hail and wind-borne debris, and the premium coating system ensures decades of service life. Suitable for large-span industrial buildings where roof access for maintenance is required and where maximum durability justifies the investment. For industrial facility managers and developers of large-span structures who need the strongest aluminum roofing available. Condition: Brand new, factory-coated aluminum, full length delivery.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 5000, '/assets/products/longspan-aluminium-roofing-sheet-3.webp', 6000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('stone-coated-steel-roofing-tile', 'Stone-Coated Steel Roofing Tile — Milano Design, Per Piece (New)', 'roofing', 3200, 3200, 2000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/stone-coated-steel-roofing-tile.webp', 'Stone-Coated Steel Roofing Tile in Milano design brings Mediterranean elegance to Nigerian architecture. The galvanized steel base with aluminum-zinc coating provides structural strength and corrosion resistance, while the natural stone chip coating creates the texture and appearance of traditional clay or slate tiles. The Milano profile with its distinctive curved shape adds dimensional beauty to roofscapes, and the interlocking design provides excellent wind uplift resistance. The stone coating reflects solar heat, reducing attic temperatures compared to plain metal roofing. For luxury residential developers and architects who want the prestige of natural tile appearance with the structural security of steel. Condition: Brand new, factory stone-coated, individual tile packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2000, '/assets/products/stone-coated-steel-roofing-tile.webp', 2000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('stone-coated-steel-roofing-tile-1', 'Stone-Coated Steel Roofing Tile — Classic Design, Per Piece (New)', 'roofing', 3000, 3000, 2000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/stone-coated-steel-roofing-tile-1.webp', 'Stone-Coated Steel Roofing Tile in Classic design offers traditional rectangular tile aesthetics with modern steel performance. The multi-layer coating system includes galvanized steel base, aluminum-zinc alloy layer, acrylic primer, ceramic-coated stone chips, and acrylic overglaze for UV protection. The classic flat profile with subtle texturing suits colonial, traditional, and contemporary architectural styles, and the lightweight construction reduces structural requirements compared to concrete or clay tiles. The interlocking edges prevent water penetration even in driving rain. For homeowners and developers who want versatile, traditional tile appearance with steel durability and reduced structural loading. Condition: Brand new, factory stone-coated, individual tile packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2000, '/assets/products/stone-coated-steel-roofing-tile-1.webp', 2000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('stone-coated-steel-roofing-tile-2', 'Stone-Coated Steel Roofing Tile — Shingle Design, Per Piece (New)', 'roofing', 2800, 2800, 2000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/stone-coated-steel-roofing-tile-2.webp', 'Stone-Coated Steel Roofing Tile in Shingle design creates the layered, textured appearance of asphalt shingle roofing with superior longevity. The overlapping shingle pattern provides dimensional depth and shadow lines that enhance roof aesthetics, and the stone coating creates natural color variation that mimics weathered wood or slate. The lightweight steel base eliminates the structural concerns of heavy shingle materials, and the fire-resistant construction provides added safety. Suitable for residential roofs where textured, layered appearance is desired with the durability of stone-coated steel. For residential developers in upscale neighborhoods who want distinctive, textured roofscapes with premium material performance. Condition: Brand new, factory stone-coated, individual tile packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2000, '/assets/products/stone-coated-steel-roofing-tile-2.webp', 2000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('stone-coated-steel-roofing-tile-3', 'Stone-Coated Steel Roofing Tile — Roman Design, Per Piece (New)', 'roofing', 3500, 3500, 2000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/stone-coated-steel-roofing-tile-3.webp', 'Stone-Coated Steel Roofing Tile in Roman design brings the grandeur of European villa architecture to Nigerian homes. The distinctive S-curved profile creates dramatic shadow lines and three-dimensional roofscapes reminiscent of Italian and Spanish colonial architecture. The heavy-gauge steel base with premium stone coating provides the weight and substance that conveys permanence and luxury. The interlocking design with deep water channels handles the heaviest tropical rainfall, and the stone coating provides natural insulation and sound dampening. For luxury estate developers and homeowners who want statement-making roof architecture with European grandeur and tropical performance. Condition: Brand new, factory stone-coated, individual tile packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2000, '/assets/products/stone-coated-steel-roofing-tile-3.webp', 3000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('fibre-cement-roofing-sheet', 'Fibre Cement Roofing Sheet — 6ft Length, Corrugated, Per Sheet (New)', 'cement-concrete', 3800, 3800, 3000, 10, 6.0, '/assets/products/fibre-cement-roofing-sheet.webp', 'Fibre Cement Roofing Sheet is the durable, fire-resistant roofing material trusted for decades in tropical construction. The Portland cement and fiber composite provides excellent weather resistance, fire immunity, and acoustic insulation. The corrugated profile sheds water efficiently and provides structural strength for purlin spacings up to 1.2 meters. The natural cement color weathers to an attractive patina, or can be painted to match architectural schemes. The non-conductive nature provides safety in lightning-prone areas, and the thermal mass reduces heat transmission compared to metal roofing. For schools, hospitals, agricultural buildings, and residential projects where fire safety and acoustic comfort are priorities. Condition: Brand new, factory-cured fibre cement, stacked delivery.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 3000, '/assets/products/fibre-cement-roofing-sheet.webp', 3000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('fibre-cement-roofing-sheet-1', 'Fibre Cement Roofing Sheet — 8ft Length, Corrugated, Per Sheet (New)', 'cement-concrete', 4800, 4800, 3000, 10, 6.0, '/assets/products/fibre-cement-roofing-sheet-1.webp', 'Fibre Cement Roofing Sheet 8ft length reduces laps and installation time on large roofs while providing the same fire-resistant, durable performance. The longer sheet minimizes end-lap joints where leakage risk is highest, and the consistent corrugated profile ensures proper overlap and water shedding. The cement-fiber composition provides natural thermal insulation and excellent sound absorption, creating quieter interiors during rain. The non-combustible rating meets building code requirements for institutional and high-density residential buildings. For institutional contractors and developers of large-span buildings who want reduced installation joints with proven fire-safe roofing. Condition: Brand new, factory-cured fibre cement, stacked delivery.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 3000, '/assets/products/fibre-cement-roofing-sheet-1.webp', 4000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('polycarbonate-roofing-sheet', 'Polycarbonate Roofing Sheet — 6mm Thick, Clear, Per Meter (New)', 'roofing', 12500, 12500, 10000, 10, 6.0, '/assets/products/polycarbonate-roofing-sheet.webp', 'Polycarbonate Roofing Sheet 6mm clear is the transparent roofing solution for skylights, covered walkways, and greenhouses. The UV-protected polycarbonate blocks harmful UV rays while transmitting up to 90% of visible light, creating bright, naturally lit spaces. The 6mm twin-wall or solid construction provides excellent impact resistance — virtually unbreakable compared to glass — and the lightweight nature simplifies installation. The thermal insulation properties of multi-wall sheets reduce heat transmission compared to glass or metal. For architects and developers who want to introduce natural daylighting into buildings with impact-safe, lightweight transparent roofing. Condition: Brand new, UV-protected polycarbonate, protective film intact.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 10000, '/assets/products/polycarbonate-roofing-sheet.webp', 11000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('polycarbonate-roofing-sheet-1', 'Polycarbonate Roofing Sheet — 10mm Thick, Bronze Tint, Per Meter (New)', 'roofing', 18500, 18500, 15000, 10, 6.0, '/assets/products/polycarbonate-roofing-sheet-1.webp', 'Polycarbonate Roofing Sheet 10mm bronze tint provides enhanced thermal performance with reduced glare for tropical applications. The bronze tint reduces solar heat gain and glare while maintaining good light transmission, and the 10mm multi-wall construction provides excellent thermal insulation with U-values as low as 2.5 W/m²K. The co-extruded UV protection layer prevents yellowing and embrittlement, ensuring 10-year clarity warranties. Suitable for swimming pool enclosures, restaurant terraces, and residential patios where solar control and comfort are priorities. For developers of outdoor leisure spaces who want comfortable, shaded environments with natural lighting and weather protection. Condition: Brand new, UV-protected polycarbonate, protective film intact.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 15000, '/assets/products/polycarbonate-roofing-sheet-1.webp', 16000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('roofing-felt', 'Roofing Felt — SBS Modified, 4mm Thick, Per Roll (10m x 1m) (New)', 'roofing', 18500, 18500, 15000, 10, 25.0, '/assets/products/roofing-felt.webp', 'SBS Modified Roofing Felt 4mm is the high-performance underlayment and waterproofing membrane for flat and low-slope roofs. The Styrene-Butadiene-Styrene modification provides exceptional flexibility at low temperatures and superior elongation for thermal movement accommodation. The 4mm thickness provides robust puncture resistance during installation and service, and the polyester or fiberglass reinforcement ensures dimensional stability. The torch-on or self-adhesive application creates seamless waterproof barriers beneath tiles, metal, or protective screeds. For roofing contractors and waterproofing specialists who need premium underlayment that accommodates building movement and provides long-term waterproof security. Condition: Brand new, factory-wrapped roll, batch-coded.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 15000, '/assets/products/roofing-felt.webp', 16000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('roofing-felt-1', 'Roofing Felt — APP Modified, 3mm Thick, Per Roll (10m x 1m) (New)', 'roofing', 14500, 14500, 11000, 10, 25.0, '/assets/products/roofing-felt-1.webp', 'APP Modified Roofing Felt 3mm is the cost-effective waterproofing membrane for standard flat roof applications. The Atactic Polypropylene modification provides good heat resistance and UV stability for exposed or covered applications, and the 3mm thickness offers adequate waterproofing for low-traffic roofs. The torch-applied installation creates strong adhesion to concrete and insulation substrates, and the mineral-granule surface option provides UV protection for exposed applications. Suitable for residential flat roofs, balcony waterproofing, and as underlayment for tiled roofs. For budget-conscious roofing contractors who need reliable waterproofing membrane for standard applications. Condition: Brand new, factory-wrapped roll, batch-coded.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 11000, '/assets/products/roofing-felt-1.webp', 13000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('roofing-nails', 'Roofing Nails — 2.5 Inch, Galvanized, 1kg Pack (New)', 'roofing', 2800, 2800, 2000, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/roofing-nails.webp', 'Roofing Nails 2.5 inch galvanized are the standard fasteners for securing roofing sheets to timber purlins. The galvanized coating prevents rust streaking on roof surfaces, and the large flat head provides secure holding without pulling through sheet material. The sharp diamond point enables easy driving into hardwood and softwood purlins, and the consistent shank diameter ensures uniform grip. Each 1kg pack contains approximately 180-200 nails, sufficient for 15-20 square meters of roofing. For roofing contractors and carpenters who need reliable, corrosion-resistant fasteners for standard roofing installations. Condition: Brand new, galvanized steel nails, sealed pack.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2000, '/assets/products/roofing-nails.webp', 2000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('roofing-screws', 'Roofing Screws — Self-Drilling, Hex Head, with Washer, 50 Pieces (New)', 'roofing', 4500, 4500, 3000, 10, 2.0, '/assets/products/roofing-screws.webp', 'Self-Drilling Roofing Screws with bonded washers are the professional fasteners for metal roofing installation. The self-drilling point eliminates pre-drilling, speeding installation and reducing labor costs. The hex head enables high-torque driving with standard socket tools, and the EPDM rubber washer creates a waterproof seal under the metal cap. The zinc-plated or galvanized finish resists corrosion for the life of the roof, and the fine thread pitch provides secure holding in steel purlins. Each pack of 50 screws covers approximately 10-12 square meters of roofing. For professional roofing contractors who want fast, watertight metal roofing installation with minimal labor. Condition: Brand new, zinc-plated self-drilling screws with EPDM washers.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 3000, '/assets/products/roofing-screws.webp', 4000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ridge-cap', 'Ridge Cap — Aluminium, Metcoppo Profile, Per Piece (2.4m) (New)', 'roofing', 5500, 5500, 4000, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/ridge-cap.webp', 'Aluminium Ridge Cap in Metcoppo profile is the finishing element that protects roof peaks while maintaining architectural consistency. The profiled design matches Metcoppo roofing sheets for seamless visual integration, and the extended coverage on both sides of the ridge prevents wind-driven rain penetration. The aluminum construction matches the longevity of the main roof sheets, and the color coating ensures consistent appearance. The 2.4-meter length reduces joints along the ridge line, and the pre-formed shape eliminates on-site bending. For roofing contractors who want factory-formed ridge caps that match main roof profiles and provide reliable weather protection at roof peaks. Condition: Brand new, factory-formed aluminum ridge cap, color-matched coating.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 4000, '/assets/products/ridge-cap.webp', 5000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('barge-board', 'Barge Board — Aluminium, Metcoppo Profile, Per Piece (2.4m) (New)', 'roofing', 4200, 4200, 3000, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/barge-board.webp', 'Aluminium Barge Board in Metcoppo profile provides the finishing touch at gable ends while protecting roof edges from wind uplift. The profiled design matches Metcoppo roofing for architectural consistency, and the extended flashing prevents water ingress at the roof-wall junction. The aluminum construction ensures longevity matching the main roof, and the pre-formed shape eliminates field fabrication. The 2.4-meter length covers standard gable heights with minimal joints. For roofing contractors and builders who want factory-finished gable trim that protects roof edges and completes the architectural appearance. Condition: Brand new, factory-formed aluminum barge board, color-matched coating.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 3000, '/assets/products/barge-board.webp', 3000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('gutter', 'Gutter — Aluminium, Half-Round, 0.55mm, Per Meter (New)', 'roofing', 3800, 3800, 3000, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/gutter.webp', 'Aluminium Half-Round Gutter in 0.55mm gauge is the durable rainwater collection system for residential and commercial buildings. The half-round profile provides excellent self-cleaning with minimal debris accumulation, and the 0.55mm thickness ensures rigidity for spans up to 1.2 meters between brackets. The aluminum construction eliminates rust and corrosion concerns, and the factory-applied color coating matches roofing materials. The standard 100mm or 125mm diameters handle typical rainfall intensities, and the pre-formed corners and outlets simplify installation. For builders and homeowners who want maintenance-free gutters that complement aluminum roofing and provide reliable rainwater management. Condition: Brand new, factory-formed aluminum gutter, color-coated.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 3000, '/assets/products/gutter.webp', 3000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('downpipe', 'Downpipe — Aluminium, Circular, 75mm Diameter, Per Meter (New)', 'roofing', 2800, 2800, 2000, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/downpipe.webp', 'Aluminium Downpipe 75mm diameter is the vertical drainage component that channels rainwater from gutters to ground level. The circular profile provides optimal flow capacity with minimal blockage risk, and the 75mm diameter handles typical roof areas up to 100 square meters. The aluminum construction matches gutter and roofing longevity, and the color coating ensures visual consistency. The standard 3-meter lengths reduce joints, and the swaged ends enable secure push-fit connections. Suitable for residential and light commercial applications with standard rainfall. For builders installing complete aluminum rainwater systems who need durable, color-matched downpipes. Condition: Brand new, factory-formed aluminum downpipe, color-coated.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2000, '/assets/products/downpipe.webp', 2000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('gutter-bracket', 'Gutter Bracket — Aluminium, Half-Round, Per Piece (New)', 'roofing', 450, 450, 0, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/gutter-bracket.webp', 'Aluminium Gutter Bracket is the support hardware that secures gutters to fascia boards and roof structures. The aluminum construction matches the gutter material, preventing galvanic corrosion, and the pre-drilled mounting holes simplify installation. The bracket spacing of 600-800mm provides adequate support for standard gutter loads, and the adjustable designs accommodate varying roof pitches. The color-matched finish maintains visual consistency. For roofing contractors who need reliable gutter supports that match system materials and provide secure, long-term installation. Condition: Brand new, aluminum gutter bracket, color-matched.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/gutter-bracket.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pvc-pressure-pipe', 'PVC Pressure Pipe — 1/2 Inch (20mm), Class C, Full Length (6m) (New)', 'building-materials', 2200, 2200, 1000, 10, 25.0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-pipe.webp', 'PVC Pressure Pipe 1/2 inch Class C is the standard water distribution pipe for cold water plumbing in residential buildings. The unplasticized PVC construction provides excellent corrosion resistance, smooth interior walls for minimal flow resistance, and long service life exceeding 50 years. The Class C pressure rating handles typical municipal water pressures up to 9 bar, and the solvent weld jointing creates permanent, leak-free connections. The light weight enables easy handling and installation by single workers, and the white color provides clean aesthetics for exposed installations. For plumbing contractors who want reliable, long-lasting cold water distribution with proven jointing technology. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PVC pipe, NIS certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1000, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-pipe.webp', 2000, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pvc-pressure-pipe-1', 'PVC Pressure Pipe — 3/4 Inch (25mm), Class C, Full Length (6m) (New)', 'building-materials', 3200, 3200, 2000, 10, 25.0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-pipe-1.webp', 'PVC Pressure Pipe 3/4 inch Class C is the primary cold water distribution pipe for residential and light commercial buildings. The larger diameter provides increased flow capacity for main distribution lines serving multiple fixtures, and the Class C rating ensures adequate pressure capacity. The smooth bore minimizes pressure loss and prevents scale buildup, maintaining flow rates over decades of service. The solvent weld jointing creates homogeneous connections as strong as the pipe itself, and the light weight simplifies installation in ceiling spaces and wall chases. For plumbing contractors installing main cold water distribution who need reliable, high-capacity piping with permanent jointing. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PVC pipe, NIS certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2000, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-pipe-1.webp', 2000, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pvc-pressure-pipe-2', 'PVC Pressure Pipe — 1 Inch (32mm), Class C, Full Length (6m) (New)', 'building-materials', 4800, 4800, 3000, 10, 25.0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-pipe-2.webp', 'PVC Pressure Pipe 1 inch Class C is the main distribution pipe for commercial buildings and large residential installations. The 32mm diameter provides substantial flow capacity for buildings with multiple bathrooms, kitchens, and utility rooms. The Class C pressure rating handles municipal supply pressures with safety margin, and the UV-stabilized formulation enables temporary exposed installation. The solvent weld system provides permanent, reliable joints, and the consistent dimensions ensure compatibility with standard fittings. Suitable for main risers, distribution headers, and commercial cold water services. For commercial plumbing contractors who need large-diameter PVC for high-capacity water distribution systems. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PVC pipe, NIS certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 3000, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-pipe-2.webp', 4000, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pvc-pressure-pipe-3', 'PVC Pressure Pipe — 2 Inch (63mm), Class C, Full Length (6m) (New)', 'building-materials', 12500, 12500, 10000, 10, 25.0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-pipe-3.webp', 'PVC Pressure Pipe 2 inch Class C is the large-diameter pipe for commercial water mains, irrigation systems, and industrial process water. The 63mm diameter provides high flow capacity with minimal pressure drop over long runs, and the Class C rating handles elevated pressures in multi-story distribution. The chemical-resistant PVC construction suits industrial applications, and the smooth interior prevents biofilm accumulation. The solvent weld jointing creates strong, permanent connections suitable for buried and exposed installations. For commercial contractors, irrigation engineers, and industrial plumbers who need large-diameter pressure pipe for high-capacity applications. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PVC pipe, NIS certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 10000, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-pipe-3.webp', 11000, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pvc-pressure-pipe-4', 'PVC Pressure Pipe — 4 Inch (110mm), Class C, Full Length (6m) (New)', 'building-materials', 32500, 32500, 26000, 10, 25.0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-pipe-4.webp', 'PVC Pressure Pipe 4 inch Class C is the extra-large pipe for municipal water distribution, large irrigation systems, and industrial process lines. The 110mm diameter provides massive flow capacity for community water schemes and large commercial complexes. The thick Class C wall handles elevated pressures and provides mechanical protection for buried installations. The chemical resistance of PVC suits aggressive water conditions, and the light weight compared to metal pipe simplifies handling and installation. Suitable for water treatment plants, large estates, and agricultural irrigation mains. For municipal contractors and large-scale irrigation developers who need maximum-capacity pressure pipe with proven durability. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PVC pipe, NIS certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 26000, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-pipe-4.webp', 29000, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pvc-pressure-fitting', 'PVC Pressure Fitting — Elbow 90°, 1/2 Inch, Socket Type, Per Piece (New)', 'building-materials', 180, 180, 0, 10, 25.0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-fitting.webp', 'PVC Pressure Elbow 90° 1/2 inch is the standard directional fitting for cold water plumbing. The socket-type design enables solvent weld connection to PVC pipe, creating permanent, leak-free 90-degree turns in distribution lines. The molded construction ensures consistent wall thickness and pressure rating matching the pipe, and the smooth interior maintains flow efficiency. Suitable for directional changes in wall chases, ceiling spaces, and exposed installations. For plumbing contractors who need reliable, permanent directional fittings for standard residential water distribution. Condition: Brand new, injection-molded PVC fitting, NIS certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-fitting.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pvc-pressure-fitting-1', 'PVC Pressure Fitting — Tee 1/2 Inch, Socket Type, Per Piece (New)', 'building-materials', 220, 220, 0, 10, 25.0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-fitting-1.webp', 'PVC Pressure Tee 1/2 inch is the branch fitting that divides water distribution lines. The socket-type solvent weld connections create permanent branches for fixture supply lines, and the molded construction ensures pressure rating consistency with the pipe. The smooth interior minimizes turbulence and pressure loss at branch points, and the compact design fits in tight wall chases. Suitable for branching to sinks, toilets, showers, and outdoor taps in residential plumbing. For plumbing contractors who need reliable branch fittings for standard residential water distribution layouts. Condition: Brand new, injection-molded PVC fitting, NIS certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-fitting-1.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pvc-pressure-fitting-2', 'PVC Pressure Fitting — Union 1/2 Inch, Socket Type, Per Piece (New)', 'building-materials', 350, 350, 0, 10, 25.0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-fitting-2.webp', 'PVC Pressure Union 1/2 inch is the demountable fitting that enables future maintenance and equipment replacement. The union design allows disconnection of pipe sections without cutting, facilitating valve and pump replacement. The solvent weld sockets connect to standard PVC pipe, and the threaded union nut creates a reliable seal that can be reopened. The EPDM or nitrile seal ensures long-term watertight performance. Suitable for connections to pumps, valves, meters, and any equipment requiring future service access. For plumbing contractors who want maintainable connections that avoid destructive disassembly. Condition: Brand new, injection-molded PVC union with EPDM seal.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-fitting-2.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pvc-pressure-fitting-3', 'PVC Pressure Fitting — Ball Valve 1/2 Inch, Socket Type, Per Piece (New)', 'building-materials', 1800, 1800, 1000, 10, 25.0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-fitting-3.webp', 'PVC Ball Valve 1/2 inch is the isolation valve for individual fixtures and branch lines. The quarter-turn operation provides rapid on/off control, and the full-bore design minimizes flow restriction when open. The solvent weld sockets create permanent pipe connections, and the molded PVC body resists corrosion and scaling. The PTFE seats ensure smooth operation and long service life, and the locking handle prevents accidental operation. Suitable for isolating toilets, sinks, outdoor taps, and equipment for maintenance. For plumbing contractors who need reliable, corrosion-resistant isolation valves with permanent PVC connections. Condition: Brand new, molded PVC ball valve with PTFE seats.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1000, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-fitting-3.webp', 1000, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pvc-pressure-fitting-4', 'PVC Pressure Fitting — Ball Valve 1 Inch, Socket Type, Per Piece (New)', 'building-materials', 3500, 3500, 2000, 10, 25.0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-fitting-4.webp', 'PVC Ball Valve 1 inch is the large isolation valve for main distribution lines and commercial applications. The quarter-turn full-bore design provides rapid isolation with minimal flow restriction, and the robust molded construction handles higher flow forces. The solvent weld sockets create permanent connections to 1-inch PVC pipe, and the lever handle provides clear open/close indication. Suitable for main line isolation, pump bypasses, and commercial fixture isolation. For commercial plumbing contractors who need large-diameter isolation valves with permanent PVC connections and reliable operation. Condition: Brand new, molded PVC ball valve with PTFE seats.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2000, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-fitting-4.webp', 3000, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pvc-pressure-fitting-5', 'PVC Pressure Fitting — Check Valve 1 Inch, Socket Type, Per Piece (New)', 'building-materials', 2800, 2800, 2000, 10, 25.0, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-fitting-5.webp', 'PVC Check Valve 1 inch is the backflow prevention device that protects water systems from contamination. The swing or spring-loaded design allows flow in one direction only, preventing back-siphonage and back-pressure from entering the supply. The solvent weld sockets integrate with standard PVC pipe, and the corrosion-resistant construction ensures long-term reliability. Suitable for pump discharge lines, tank inlets, and any application where backflow prevention is required. For plumbing contractors and water system engineers who need reliable backflow protection in PVC piping systems. Condition: Brand new, molded PVC check valve with EPDM seal.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2000, '/assets/products/pvc-pressure-fitting-5.webp', 2000, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pvc-waste-pipe', 'PVC Waste Pipe — 2 Inch (50mm), Per Length (4m) (New)', 'plumbing', 1800, 1800, 1000, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/pvc-waste-pipe.webp', 'PVC Waste Pipe 2 inch is the standard pipe for sink, basin, and shower waste drainage. The 50mm diameter provides adequate flow capacity for individual fixtures, and the smooth interior prevents clogging and enables easy rodding. The solvent weld or push-fit jointing options accommodate different installation preferences, and the light weight simplifies installation in floor slabs and wall chases. The gray color distinguishes waste lines from pressure pipes, and the chemical resistance handles typical household effluent. For plumbing contractors installing standard residential waste drainage who need reliable, easy-to-install pipework. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PVC waste pipe, NIS certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1000, '/assets/products/pvc-waste-pipe.webp', 1000, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pvc-waste-pipe-1', 'PVC Waste Pipe — 3 Inch (75mm), Per Length (4m) (New)', 'plumbing', 3200, 3200, 2000, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/pvc-waste-pipe-1.webp', 'PVC Waste Pipe 3 inch is the primary soil and waste pipe for toilet connections and main drainage stacks. The 75mm diameter handles solid waste and paper with adequate flow velocity to prevent blockage, and the robust wall thickness withstands building settlement and ground movement. The socket and spigot design with rubber ring joint enables flexible, demountable connections, and the gray color identifies waste systems. Suitable for WC connections, soil stacks, and main drainage lines in residential and commercial buildings. For plumbing contractors who need reliable soil and waste pipe with flexible jointing for building drainage systems. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PVC soil pipe with rubber ring joint.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2000, '/assets/products/pvc-waste-pipe-1.webp', 2000, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

