VALUES ('pvc-waste-pipe-2', 'PVC Waste Pipe — 4 Inch (110mm), Per Length (4m) (New)', 'plumbing', 5500, 5500, 4000, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/pvc-waste-pipe-2.webp', 'PVC Waste Pipe 4 inch is the large soil pipe for main drainage stacks and commercial waste systems. The 110mm diameter provides high flow capacity for multiple fixture connections and commercial applications, and the thick wall withstands external loads in buried installations. The rubber ring joint system accommodates thermal movement and ground settlement without leakage, and the smooth interior enables effective rodding and jetting for maintenance. Suitable for main soil stacks, commercial drainage, and buried sewer connections. For commercial plumbing contractors and drainage engineers who need large-diameter soil pipe with robust construction and flexible jointing. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PVC soil pipe with rubber ring joint.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 4000, '/assets/products/pvc-waste-pipe-2.webp', 5000, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

