VALUES ('pvc-waste-fitting', 'PVC Waste Fitting — Bend 90° Short Radius, 4 Inch, Per Piece (New)', 'plumbing', 850, 850, 0, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/pvc-waste-fitting.webp', 'PVC Waste Bend 90° Short Radius 4 inch is the directional fitting for soil stack changes of direction. The short radius design minimizes space requirements in congested service ducts, and the rubber ring socket connects to standard 4-inch soil pipe. The smooth interior radius maintains flow efficiency and prevents solid accumulation at bends. Suitable for stack offsets, directional changes in buried drains, and connection to inspection chambers. For drainage contractors who need compact directional fittings for soil and waste systems with reliable rubber ring jointing. Condition: Brand new, injection-molded PVC bend with rubber ring socket.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/pvc-waste-fitting.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

