VALUES ('pvc-waste-fitting-1', 'PVC Waste Fitting — Inspection Chamber Base, 4 Inch, Per Piece (New)', 'plumbing', 4500, 4500, 3000, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/pvc-waste-fitting-1.webp', 'PVC Inspection Chamber Base 4 inch is the access point for drain maintenance and blockage clearance. The molded base provides connection points for inlet and outlet pipes with built-in benching for flow direction, and the removable cover enables rodding and jetting access. The robust construction withstands traffic loads when installed at ground level, and the chemical-resistant PVC handles sewer gases and effluent. Suitable for buried drainage systems at junctions, direction changes, and intervals along straight runs. For drainage contractors who need reliable access points for future drain maintenance and inspection. Condition: Brand new, injection-molded PVC inspection chamber with cover.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 3000, '/assets/products/pvc-waste-fitting-1.webp', 4000, 4.5, 0, 'PVC', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

