VALUES ('ppr-pipe', 'PPR Pipe — 20mm (1/2 Inch), SDR 6, Hot & Cold Water, Per Meter (New)', 'plumbing', 450, 450, 0, 10, 15.0, '/assets/products/ppr-pipe.webp', 'PPR Pipe 20mm SDR 6 is the modern hot and cold water distribution pipe for residential and commercial plumbing. The Polypropylene Random copolymer provides excellent temperature resistance up to 95°C for hot water and freeze resistance for cold water. The heat fusion jointing creates monolithic, leak-free connections stronger than the pipe itself, and the smooth interior prevents scale buildup maintaining flow rates. The light green or white color provides clean aesthetics, and the 50-year service life exceeds traditional metal piping. For modern plumbing contractors who want a complete hot and cold water system with fusion-welded permanent joints and corrosion-free performance. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PPR pipe, ISO certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/ppr-pipe.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'PPR', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

