VALUES ('ppr-fitting', 'PPR Fitting — Elbow 90°, 20mm, Socket Fusion, Per Piece (New)', 'plumbing', 180, 180, 0, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/ppr-fitting.webp', 'PPR Elbow 90° 20mm is the directional fitting for PPR hot and cold water systems. The socket fusion design enables heat-welded connection to PPR pipe, creating permanent, homogeneous joints with strength exceeding the pipe. The molded construction ensures consistent wall thickness and pressure rating, and the smooth interior maintains flow efficiency. Suitable for directional changes in wall chases, ceiling spaces, and exposed installations. For plumbing contractors installing PPR systems who need reliable fusion-welded directional fittings. Condition: Brand new, injection-molded PPR fitting, ISO certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/ppr-fitting.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'PPR', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ppr-fitting-1', 'PPR Fitting — Tee 20mm, Socket Fusion, Per Piece (New)', 'plumbing', 220, 220, 0, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/ppr-fitting-1.webp', 'PPR Tee 20mm is the branch fitting for PPR water distribution systems. The socket fusion connections create permanent branches for fixture supply lines, and the molded construction ensures pressure rating consistency. The smooth interior minimizes turbulence at branch points, and the compact design fits in tight wall chases. Suitable for branching to sinks, toilets, showers, and appliances in PPR plumbing systems. For plumbing contractors who need reliable branch fittings for PPR hot and cold water distribution. Condition: Brand new, injection-molded PPR fitting, ISO certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/ppr-fitting-1.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'PPR', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ppr-fitting-2', 'PPR Fitting — Ball Valve 20mm, Socket Fusion, Per Piece (New)', 'plumbing', 1500, 1500, 1000, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/ppr-fitting-2.webp', 'PPR Ball Valve 20mm is the isolation valve for PPR water systems. The socket fusion ends enable permanent connection to PPR pipe, and the brass or PPR ball mechanism provides reliable quarter-turn operation. The full-bore design minimizes flow restriction when open, and the locking handle prevents accidental operation. Suitable for isolating individual fixtures, branch lines, and equipment in PPR plumbing systems. For plumbing contractors who need corrosion-resistant isolation valves integrated with PPR fusion systems. Condition: Brand new, PPR ball valve with brass or ceramic ball.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1000, '/assets/products/ppr-fitting-2.webp', 1000, 4.5, 0, 'PPR', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ppr-fitting-3', 'PPR Fitting — Stop Valve 20mm, Socket Fusion, Per Piece (New)', 'plumbing', 1200, 1200, 0, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/ppr-fitting-3.webp', 'PPR Stop Valve 20mm is the regulation valve for PPR systems. The socket fusion connections integrate with standard PPR pipe, and the rising spindle or non-rising spindle design enables flow regulation and positive shutoff. The EPDM or PTFE seal ensures long-term watertight performance, and the robust handle withstands frequent operation. Suitable for regulating flow to individual fixtures and zones in PPR plumbing systems. For plumbing contractors who need reliable regulation and isolation in PPR hot and cold water systems. Condition: Brand new, PPR stop valve with EPDM seal.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/ppr-fitting-3.webp', 1000, 4.5, 0, 'PPR', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ppr-fitting-4', 'PPR Fitting — Male Threaded Adapter 20mm x 1/2 Inch, Per Piece (New)', 'plumbing', 280, 280, 0, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/ppr-fitting-4.webp', 'PPR Male Threaded Adapter 20mm x 1/2 inch enables connection between PPR pipe and standard BSP threaded fittings. The socket fusion end connects to PPR pipe, and the precision-machined male thread connects to taps, valves, and metal fittings. The brass or PPR insert ensures thread strength and prevents cracking under torque. Suitable for connecting PPR systems to sanitary ware, pumps, and existing metal piping. For plumbing contractors who need reliable transition fittings between PPR and threaded metal components. Condition: Brand new, PPR male adapter with brass insert.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/ppr-fitting-4.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'PPR', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ppr-fitting-5', 'PPR Fitting — Female Threaded Adapter 20mm x 1/2 Inch, Per Piece (New)', 'plumbing', 280, 280, 0, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/ppr-fitting-5.webp', 'PPR Female Threaded Adapter 20mm x 1/2 inch enables connection from PPR pipe to male-threaded fittings and equipment. The socket fusion end connects to PPR pipe, and the precision female thread accepts standard BSP male fittings. The brass insert reinforcement prevents thread deformation under pressure and torque. Suitable for connecting PPR systems to water heaters, pumps, pressure tanks, and threaded valves. For plumbing contractors who need reliable female-threaded transition fittings for PPR system integration. Condition: Brand new, PPR female adapter with brass insert.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/ppr-fitting-5.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'PPR', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ppr-fusion-welding-machine', 'PPR Fusion Welding Machine — 20-63mm, Digital Temperature Control (New)', 'building-materials', 28500, 28500, 23000, 10, 5.0, '/assets/products/ppr-fusion-welding-machine.webp', 'PPR Fusion Welding Machine 20-63mm is the essential tool for installing PPR plumbing systems. The digital temperature control maintains optimal fusion temperature for consistent, strong welds, and the interchangeable heating inserts accommodate pipe sizes from 20mm to 63mm. The ergonomic handles and stable base enable controlled insertion and heating, and the thermal insulation prevents burns during operation. The included depth gauges ensure proper insertion depth for full-strength joints. For plumbing contractors who want professional-grade fusion equipment for reliable PPR installation with consistent weld quality. Condition: Brand new, digital PPR fusion machine with inserts and accessories.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 23000, '/assets/products/ppr-fusion-welding-machine.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, 'PPR', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('hdpe-pipe', 'HDPE Pipe — 20mm, PN10, Water Supply, Per Meter (New)', 'plumbing', 350, 350, 0, 10, 15.0, '/assets/products/hdpe-pipe.webp', 'HDPE Pipe 20mm PN10 is the flexible water supply pipe for rural water schemes and irrigation. The High-Density Polyethylene provides excellent flexibility for laying in undulating terrain without fittings, and the PN10 pressure rating handles typical water distribution pressures. The butt fusion or electrofusion jointing creates permanent, leak-free connections, and the black color with UV stabilizer enables exposed installation. The chemical resistance handles aggressive water conditions, and the 50-year service life minimizes replacement costs. For rural water project contractors and irrigation engineers who need flexible, durable water distribution pipe with fusion jointing. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded HDPE pipe, ISO certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/hdpe-pipe.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'HDPE', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('hdpe-pipe-1', 'HDPE Pipe — 63mm, PN10, Water Supply, Per Meter (New)', 'plumbing', 1850, 1850, 1000, 10, 15.0, '/assets/products/hdpe-pipe-1.webp', 'HDPE Pipe 63mm PN10 is the medium-diameter flexible pipe for community water schemes and agricultural irrigation. The larger diameter provides substantial flow capacity for village water systems and large irrigation zones, and the PN10 rating ensures adequate pressure capacity. The butt fusion jointing creates strong, homogeneous connections that match pipe strength, and the flexibility accommodates ground movement without joint failure. The chemical and abrasion resistance suits harsh installation conditions. For water project contractors and agricultural developers who need medium-diameter flexible pipe for reliable water distribution. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded HDPE pipe, ISO certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1000, '/assets/products/hdpe-pipe-1.webp', 1000, 4.5, 0, 'HDPE', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('hdpe-pipe-2', 'HDPE Pipe — 110mm, PN10, Water Supply, Per Meter (New)', 'plumbing', 5500, 5500, 4000, 10, 15.0, '/assets/products/hdpe-pipe-2.webp', 'HDPE Pipe 110mm PN10 is the large-diameter flexible pipe for municipal water distribution and large irrigation mains. The substantial diameter provides high flow capacity with minimal pressure loss over long distances, and the PN10 rating handles elevated distribution pressures. The butt fusion jointing creates seamless pipelines with no leakage points, and the flexibility accommodates trenchless installation and ground movement. The abrasion resistance handles sediment-laden water, and the 100-year design life minimizes infrastructure replacement. For municipal water engineers and large-scale irrigation developers who need maximum-capacity flexible pipe with fusion-welded integrity. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded HDPE pipe, ISO certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 4000, '/assets/products/hdpe-pipe-2.webp', 5000, 4.5, 0, 'HDPE', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('hdpe-fitting', 'HDPE Fitting — Electrofusion Coupler 63mm, Per Piece (New)', 'plumbing', 1200, 1200, 0, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/hdpe-fitting.webp', 'HDPE Electrofusion Coupler 63mm is the jointing fitting that creates permanent HDPE pipe connections using embedded heating wires. The electrofusion process heats the internal wires, melting the pipe and fitting together into a homogeneous joint stronger than the pipe. The integrated barcode enables automatic welding parameter control with compatible machines, ensuring consistent joint quality. Suitable for water supply, gas distribution, and industrial applications where permanent, reliable joints are essential. For pipeline contractors who need precision jointing technology for HDPE systems with automatic quality control. Condition: Brand new, HDPE electrofusion coupler with embedded heating wires.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/hdpe-fitting.webp', 1000, 4.5, 0, 'HDPE', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('hdpe-fitting-1', 'HDPE Fitting — Butt Fusion Elbow 90°, 63mm, Per Piece (New)', 'plumbing', 1500, 1500, 1000, 10, 8.0, '/assets/products/hdpe-fitting-1.webp', 'HDPE Butt Fusion Elbow 90° 63mm is the directional fitting for HDPE pipeline systems. The butt fusion ends enable heat-welded connection to HDPE pipe using a butt fusion machine, creating permanent, full-strength joints. The molded construction ensures consistent wall thickness and pressure rating, and the smooth interior radius maintains flow efficiency. Suitable for directional changes in water supply, irrigation, and industrial HDPE pipelines. For pipeline contractors who need reliable fusion-welded directional fittings for HDPE systems. Condition: Brand new, molded HDPE butt fusion elbow.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1000, '/assets/products/hdpe-fitting-1.webp', 1000, 4.5, 0, 'HDPE', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nigerchin-single-core-cable', 'Nigerchin Single Core Cable — 1.5mm², PVC Insulated, Red, Per Meter (New)', 'electrical', 180, 180, 0, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/nigerchin-single-core-cable.webp', 'Nigerchin Single Core Cable 1.5mm² is the standard lighting circuit cable for residential and commercial electrical installations. The high-conductivity copper conductor with PVC insulation provides reliable power distribution for lighting points and small appliances up to 15 amps. The red insulation identifies phase conductors in single-phase installations, and the NIS certification ensures compliance with Nigerian electrical standards. The flexible stranded conductor enables easy pulling through conduits and trunking. For electrical contractors who want certified, reliable cable from Nigeria''s leading manufacturer for standard lighting and power circuits. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PVC cable, NIS certified, meter-marked.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/nigerchin-single-core-cable.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'Nigerchin', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nigerchin-single-core-cable-1', 'Nigerchin Single Core Cable — 1.5mm², PVC Insulated, Black, Per Meter (New)', 'electrical', 180, 180, 0, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/nigerchin-single-core-cable-1.webp', 'Nigerchin Single Core Cable 1.5mm² black is the neutral conductor cable for standard electrical circuits. The identical construction to the red phase cable with black insulation identification ensures consistent performance and easy circuit identification during installation and maintenance. The high-purity copper conductor minimizes voltage drop over typical circuit lengths, and the PVC insulation provides adequate protection for concealed installations in walls and ceilings. Suitable for neutral connections in lighting circuits, socket circuits, and distribution boards. For electrical contractors who need certified neutral cable with clear color coding for safe, compliant installations. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PVC cable, NIS certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/nigerchin-single-core-cable-1.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'Nigerchin', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nigerchin-single-core-cable-2', 'Nigerchin Single Core Cable — 1.5mm², PVC Insulated, Green/Yellow, Per Meter (New)', 'electrical', 180, 180, 0, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/nigerchin-single-core-cable-2.webp', 'Nigerchin Single Core Cable 1.5mm² green/yellow is the earth conductor for electrical safety systems. The bicolored insulation clearly identifies protective earth conductors, and the high-conductivity copper ensures low earth impedance for effective fault current dissipation. The PVC insulation provides mechanical protection during installation, and the stranded conductor enables easy termination at earth bars and equipment. Suitable for earthing sockets, light fittings, distribution boards, and all exposed conductive parts requiring protective bonding. For electrical contractors who need certified earth cable with mandatory safety color coding for compliant earthing systems. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PVC cable, NIS certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/nigerchin-single-core-cable-2.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'Nigerchin', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nigerchin-single-core-cable-3', 'Nigerchin Single Core Cable — 2.5mm², PVC Insulated, Red, Per Meter (New)', 'electrical', 280, 280, 0, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/nigerchin-single-core-cable-3.webp', 'Nigerchin Single Core Cable 2.5mm² is the standard socket circuit cable for 13-amp power outlets. The larger conductor cross-section reduces voltage drop over longer circuit runs and provides adequate capacity for multiple socket outlets on ring or radial circuits. The PVC insulation withstands the mechanical stresses of conduit installation, and the NIS certification ensures compliance with Nigerian wiring regulations. The stranded conductor provides flexibility for easy handling and termination. For electrical contractors installing standard power outlet circuits who need certified cable with adequate capacity for typical residential and commercial loads. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PVC cable, NIS certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/nigerchin-single-core-cable-3.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'Nigerchin', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nigerchin-single-core-cable-4', 'Nigerchin Single Core Cable — 4mm², PVC Insulated, Red, Per Meter (New)', 'electrical', 420, 420, 0, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/nigerchin-single-core-cable-4.webp', 'Nigerchin Single Core Cable 4mm² is the heavy-duty cable for air conditioners, water heaters, and high-power appliances. The substantial conductor cross-section handles currents up to 30 amps with minimal voltage drop, and the robust PVC insulation provides mechanical protection for surface and conduit installations. The high-purity copper ensures efficient power delivery to demanding loads, and the NIS certification guarantees compliance with safety standards. Suitable for dedicated circuits to air conditioning units, electric water heaters, ovens, and other high-current appliances. For electrical contractors who need certified heavy-duty cable for dedicated appliance circuits with adequate safety margins. Condition: Brand new, factory-extruded PVC cable, NIS certified.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/nigerchin-single-core-cable-4.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'Nigerchin', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nigerchin-single-core-cable-5', 'Nigerchin Single Core Cable — 6mm², PVC Insulated, Red, Per Meter (New)', 'electrical', 580, 580, 0, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/nigerchin-single-core-cable-5.webp', 'Nigerchin Single Core Cable 6mm² is the extra-heavy cable for main distribution circuits, sub-main feeders, and large air conditioning units. The large conductor cross-section handles currents up to 40 amps with minimal voltage drop over long runs, making it ideal for sub-main distribution from meter panels to distribution boards. The robust PVC insulation withstands the rigors of conduit and surface installation, and the NIS certification ensures safety compliance. Suitable for main feeders, sub-mains, and large dedicated appliance circuits.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 0, '/assets/products/nigerchin-single-core-cable-5.webp', 0, 4.5, 0, 'Nigerchin', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

