VALUES ('lafarge-elephant-cement-1', 'Lafarge Elephant Cement — 50kg Bag, Grade 42.5R, Lagos (New)', 'cement-concrete', 7600, 7600, 6000, 10, 50.0, '/assets/products/lafarge-elephant-cement-1.webp', 'Lafarge Elephant Cement is the premium alternative that has built some of Nigeria''s most iconic structures. The 42.5R Portland limestone cement offers excellent workability and reduced water demand, resulting in denser concrete with lower permeability. The optimized clinker composition delivers consistent 28-day compressive strength exceeding 42.5 MPa, and the low heat of hydration minimizes thermal cracking in mass concrete pours. The bag features tamper-evident sealing and QR-code traceability for authenticity verification. Condition: Brand new, sealed Lafarge factory bag, QR-coded for authenticity.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 6000, '/assets/products/lafarge-elephant-cement-1.webp', 6000, 4.5, 0, 'Lafarge', 0, 1, 'buildmart');

